title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Host
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors a XenServer / XCP-ng host (piggyback data of the special
 agent {agent_xenserver}): product version, pool role, live and enabled state, uptime,
 number of running VMs, clock offset to the Checkmk server (default levels
 30/60 seconds) and power consumption if reported.

 It goes {CRIT} if the host is not live and {WARN} (configurable) if the host
 is disabled (maintenance mode) or no performance data is available.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer Host} per XenServer host.
